/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 36 0 R
/T (This project presents the design and implementation of an Online Food Order Management and Analysis System. Developed in Python, the system provides a menu-driven interface to manage customers, restaurants, food items, and orders efficiently. By leveraging fundamental Python data structures like dictionaries, lists, sets, and tuples, alongside file handling and exception management, the system offers a robust simulation of a real-world food delivery backend. The objective is to automate workflows, calculate bills dynamically, and generate comprehensive analytical reports.)
/E (This project presents the design and implementation of an Online Food Order Management and Analysis System. Developed in Python, the system provides a menu-driven interface to manage customers, restaurants, food items, and orders efficiently. By leveraging fundamental Python data structures like dictionaries, lists, sets, and tuples, alongside file handling and exception management, the system offers a robust simulation of a real-world food delivery backend. The objective is to automate workflows, calculate bills dynamically, and generate comprehensive analytical reports.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
